### Core
Stores application-wide settings, environment variable parsing, and security helpers.
Remember to use VALID HTTP ERROR CODES!

## Expected Files
``config.py``   - Loads `.env` settings like Secret Keys and Database URL's
``security.py`` - Password Hashing, JWT Token Generation, and Validation Helpers

